# Smart Campus Assistant – Walkthrough

## What Was Built

### Backend (`backend/`)
Complete Node.js + Express + MongoDB REST API with two resource groups.

**Directory structure:**
```
backend/
├── config/
│   └── db.js              ← MongoDB connection
├── controllers/
│   ├── busController.js   ← Bus CRUD logic
│   └── locationController.js ← Location CRUD logic
├── models/
│   ├── Bus.js             ← Bus schema
│   ├── Location.js        ← Campus location schema
│   └── Route.js           ← Route schema
├── routes/
│   ├── busRoutes.js       ← /api/buses
│   └── locationRoutes.js  ← /api/locations
├── .env                   ← PORT, MONGO_URI
├── package.json
├── seed.js                ← Seeds 15 locations + 5 buses
└── server.js              ← Express entry point
```

