## How to Run

### 1. Start MongoDB
Make sure MongoDB is running locally on port `27017`.

### 2. Start Backend
```bash
cd backend
npm run dev
# → Server on http://localhost:5000
```

### 3. Seed the Database (first time only)
```bash
cd backend
npm run seed
# → Seeds 15 campus locations + 5 sample buses
```

### 4. Start Frontend
```bash
cd frontend
npm run dev
# → App on http://localhost:5173
```

